      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.51,
          "en": "So we need a project set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.51,
          "end": 5.64,
          "en": "that supports these requirements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.64,
          "end": 8.85,
          "en": "And a popular tool for creating such projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.85,
          "end": 10.47,
          "en": "that comes with all these features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.47,
          "end": 13.02,
          "en": "and tools that we need built in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 15.81,
          "en": "is Create React App.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.81,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "This is a tool which you can use to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.91,
          "end": 19.29,
          "en": "well, as the name suggest,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.29,
          "end": 20.88,
          "en": "create React apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.88,
          "end": 22.65,
          "en": "that give you this auto reloading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.65,
          "end": 27.483,
          "en": "and that supports this HTML with JavaScript Syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 32.28,
          "en": "An alternative tool which you could use is Vite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.28,
          "end": 37.28,
          "en": "which can also be used to create new React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.35,
          "end": 39.45,
          "en": "And you can simply follow the instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.45,
          "end": 43.94,
          "en": "shared on these websites of Create React App or Vite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.94,
          "end": 47.97,
          "en": "to create valid new React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.97,
          "end": 49.59,
          "en": "Now, for both tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.59,
          "end": 52.83,
          "en": "and also to successfully then run the projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.83,
          "end": 54.66,
          "en": "created by those tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 58.53,
          "en": "you must have Node.js installed on your system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 61.86,
          "en": "Now, you don't need to be able to write Node.js code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.86,
          "end": 64.41,
          "en": "You don't need to know Node.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.41,
          "end": 67.14,
          "en": "but Node.js is used under the hood",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.14,
          "end": 69.81,
          "en": "by those tools that create the projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.81,
          "end": 71.67,
          "en": "and then also by the projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.67,
          "end": 74.46000000000001,
          "en": "and their built in-tools as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.46000000000001,
          "end": 77.91,
          "en": "So make sure you have Node.js installed on your system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.91,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "You can typically download the latest version of Node.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "or use the latest LTS version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 87.78,
          "en": "the latest long-term stability version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.78,
          "end": 89.52,
          "en": "And once you got it installed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 91.56,
          "en": "you can create those new projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.56,
          "end": 93.75,
          "en": "with \"npx create-react-app\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.75,
          "end": 95.49000000000001,
          "en": "to use that tool.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 95.49000000000001,
          "end": 98.07,
          "en": "Or by running \"npm create vite\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.07,
          "end": 99.36,
          "en": "to use that Vite tool.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.36,
          "end": 100.193,
          "en": "And I'll do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.193,
          "end": 102.453,
          "en": "but you can use either of the two approaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.65,
          "end": 105.53999999999999,
          "en": "Now, once you run these commands,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.53999999999999,
          "end": 108.57300000000001,
          "en": "you are typically asked to choose a project name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 111.9,
          "en": "And here I'll just name it \"react-crash-course\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.9,
          "end": 113.75999999999999,
          "en": "but the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 115.41,
          "en": "And then in Vite's case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.41,
          "end": 116.37,
          "en": "pick a template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 116.37,
          "end": 118.8,
          "en": "where I'll pick \"React\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 118.8,
          "end": 120.51,
          "en": "And then JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120.51,
          "end": 123.45,
          "en": "And this now creates a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 123.45,
          "end": 124.5,
          "en": "Now, once that was done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.5,
          "end": 127.17,
          "en": "you can open that newly created project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 127.17,
          "end": 128.97,
          "en": "with an editor of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 128.97,
          "end": 131.85,
          "en": "In my case, I'm using Visual Studio Code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 131.85,
          "end": 134.94,
          "en": "And you can start working on that code there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 138.99,
